2107 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 2106 0 R
  /Alt (This diagram illustrates the Urban Atlas Land Cover/Land Use (UA LC/LU) production methodology workflow, detailing the stages from input data acquisition to quality control and product verification. **Input data:** 1. **Sentinel-2 Time Series** 2. **VHR IMAGE 2018-2021** (Very High Resolution Imagery) 3. **Ancillary data** (OSM - Open Street Map, Google Earth, etc.) 4. **HRL IMD CLCplus2021** (High Resolution Layer Imperviousness Density, CORINE Land Cover plus) 5. **Tom-Tom Strava OSM** **Pre-processing:** * **Sentinel-2 Time Series** and **VHR IMAGE 2018-2021** proceed through 'Scene selection, check and correction', 'Extraction, QC and calibration' (Quality Control), and then 'Encoding'. * **Ancillary data** is used for 'Network Production (rail/road)'. * **Tom-Tom Strava OSM** is used for 'Production of GUA' (Global Urban Area). **Processing:** * The output from 'Encoding' and **VHR IMAGE 2018-2021** feed into 'Change Detection', which involves an internal iterative process. * Output from 'Change Detection' leads to 'Classification and merge'. * The combined output from 'Classification and merge' and 'Production of the new areas (CAPI)' is integrated into the 'LC/LU layer (CAPI)'. **Post-processing:** * The 'Integration into the LC/LU layer (CAPI)' feeds into 'historical and extension merge'. * 'Production of the new areas (CAPI)' and **HRL IMD CLCplus2021** feed into 'Integration of urban density + Rural classes', which then also feeds into 'historical and extension merge'. * 'Production of GUA' feeds into 'GUA integration', which subsequently connects to 'Semantic and topological checks + compliance with product specifications'. * The 'historical and extension merge' also feeds into 'Semantic and topological checks + compliance with product specifications'. **Output products:** The 'Semantic and topological checks + compliance with product specifications' step generates three final products: 1. **Change Layer UA LC/LU 2018-2021** 2. **Status layer UA LC/LU 2021** 3. **Status layer UA LC/LU 2018 revised** **Quality control and product verification:** All three output products undergo a final stage of 'External quality assessment + ETC online QC tool' (European Topic Centre).)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [0]
  /Pg 2526 0 R
>>
endobj

